            <li><a href="https://opentelemetry.io/blog/2024/hardening-the-collector-one/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry blog: a new default bind address for the Collector</a></li>
            <li><a href="/docs/reference/ingest">Maple docs: Ingest API</a></li>
            <li><a href="/opentelemetry">OpenTelemetry with Maple</a></li>
